    "answer": {
      "short": "Method 2: \\$2221.82 per month, compared with \\$2037.10 for Method 1.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Method 1 monthly income}&=0.13\\times15670\\\\&=\\$2037.10\\\\\\text{Method 2 monthly income}&=\\frac{350\\times52}{12}+0.045\\times15670\\\\&\\approx\\$2221.82\\end{align*}$$\nMethod 2 gives the greater monthly income because \\$2221.82 exceeds \\$2037.10.",
